,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'([dquant]>=[baseline_arm_1][calc_binge_threshold]) AND\n[event-name]=\"week_12_sms_arm_1\"',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,0),(271,'bd_4',NULL,'sunday',NULL,183,NULL,NULL,'descriptive','The choices made this week do not define the future. Every week offers a new chance to move toward the life you want.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'([dquant]>=[baseline_arm_1][calc_binge_threshold]) AND\n[event-name]=\"week_12_sms_arm_1\"',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,0),(271,'bd_5',NULL,'sunday',NULL,184,NULL,NULL,'descriptive','Drinking above lower-risk levels is common, but it can carry consequences that are easy to overlook in the moment and harder to ignore over time.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'([dquant]>=[baseline_arm_1][calc_binge_threshold]) AND\n[event-name]=\"week_12_sms_arm_1\"',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,0),(271,'bd_6',NULL,'sunday',NULL,185,NULL,NULL,'descriptive','Many people find that their drinking does not always align with the goals they have for their health, energy, relationships, or future.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'([dquant]>=[baseline_arm_1][calc_binge_threshold]) AND\n[event-name]=\"week_12_sms_arm_1\"',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,0),(271,'bd_7',NULL,'sunday',NULL,186,NULL,NULL,'descriptive','Lasting change often begins with noticing patterns honestly and without judgment. Awareness is an important first step.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'([dquant]>=[baseline_arm_1][calc_binge_threshold]) AND\n[event-name]=\"week_12_sms_arm_1\"',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,0),(271,'bd_8',NULL,'sunday',NULL,187,NULL,NULL,'descriptive','Alcohol can offer short-term benefits while also creating costs that may not become apparent until later. Both sides are worth keeping in mind.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'([dquant]>=[baseline_arm_1][calc_binge_threshold]) AND\n[event-name]=\"week_12_sms_arm_1\"',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,0),(271,'bd_9',NULL,'sunday',NU